   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 465 of the laws of 1994, amending chapter 285 of the\nlaws of 1891 relating to charging a fee for admission to the New York\nBotanical Garden, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S7556",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7556-2019",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §3, Chap 465 of 1994",
    "lawSection": "New York City",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S7556\n\nSPONSOR: BIAGGI\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 465 of the laws of 1994, amending chapter 285 of\nthe laws of 1891 relating to charging a fee for admission to the New\nYork Botanical Garden, in relation to the effectiveness thereof\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nThe purpose of this bill is to give the New York Botanical Garden\nauthorization to charge or not charge an admission fee.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1: Amends chapter 465 of the laws of 1994, section 3 and subse-\nquent extensions, to eliminate the expiration date authorizing the New\nYork Botanical Garden to charge a fee for admission by the general\npublic to help sustain the organization's operations and botanical\nexhibits.\n\nSection 2 sets forth the effective date\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe New York Botanical Garden (NYBG) charges nominal and varying fees\nfor admission to certain exhibits of this organization. They must be\nauthorized to continue to do so in order to remain open to the public\nand a financially viable organization that can continue to host new\nliving exhibits. This legislation will provide NYBG with parity among\nother organizations that are not required to pass legislation yearly to\ncharge admission.  The following organizations charge for admission and\ndo not require legislation to do so:\n\nBronx\n\nBronx Academy of Arts and Dance\nBronx River Arts Center\nLehman Center for the Performing Arts\nHostos Center for Performing Arts\nPregones Theater\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
